# Paths the default Telescope searches and :grep skip (gitignore syntax).
#
# Those searches ignore .gitignore, so git-ignored files that matter (.env,
# local config) still show up; this list keeps generated and vendored
# directories out instead. To search these too, use the "all files" variants:
# <leader>sG / <leader>fF / <leader>sW, or <M-i> inside the picker.
#
# A project that tracks one of these (say a real `build/` dir) can re-include
# it with `!build/` in its own .ignore, which takes precedence over this file.

